---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContactLine from '../components/ContactLine.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="Terms of use | Company Name Checker" description="The terms for using Company Name Checker: what the free tools and guides cover, their limits, and how to contact us.">
  <h1>Terms of use</h1>
  <p class="muted">Last updated 31 October 2026.</p>

  <h2>What this site is</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a free information service. It is independent and not affiliated with Companies House or any part
    of the UK government.
  </p>

  <h2>Name check results are a guide</h2>
  <p>
    The name checker applies the published Companies House "same as" rules to Companies House data. Our data is updated
    monthly and checked against Companies House live where possible, but it can be out of date, and Companies House can
    also object to names that are "too like" another or that use sensitive words. Only Companies House can accept a
    name, and it does so when you file. Don't buy branding, domains or stationery based only on our result.
  </p>

  <h2>Not professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Our guides explain official rules in plain English. They are not legal, tax or financial advice. Check the linked
    official sources, or speak to a professional, before making decisions.
  </p>

  <h2>Fair use</h2>
  <p>
    Please don't use automated tools to send large numbers of name checks. We may limit or block traffic that affects
    the service for others.
  </p>

  <h2>Links and affiliates</h2>
  <p>
    We link to other sites, including providers that may pay us a commission. We're not responsible for their content
    or services. See our <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or corrections: <ContactLine />.</p>
</Base>
